    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "Succinctly, facts of the case are that the complainant, namely, Udhampreet Singh and Navjot Singh lodged the complaint with the Police against accused, namely, (1) Romi (2) Mandeep Singh (3) Pali @ Pali Sidhu 1 of 5 Neutral Citation No:=2024:PHHC:120987 (4) Sandeep Singh (5) Happy (6) Bhupinder Singh (petitioner in CRM-M- 8006-2024) (7) Raikot (8) Sukhwinder Singh (petitioner in CRM-M-20460- 2024) and others.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1253,
      "end": 1665,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Udhampreet Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1317,
          "end": 1333
        },
        {
          "text": "Navjot Singh",
